$[Import* std]
Rolling keeps the capabilities of the functions inside a value: a Runtime function stays Runtime after it is
unrolled, so static code cannot call it.
$[Type {Stream a} rollStream unrollStream {Struct {' {Field "head" a} {Field "tail" {Fn {'} Stream}}}}]
$[# {repeat n} {rollStream {. head n tail {^ {} {repeat n}}}}]
$[# s [% {rollStream {. head 0 tail {^ {} {repeat {time}}}}}]]
${[% {.head {unrollStream {{.tail {unrollStream s}}}}}]}
expect-error: stage: requires Runtime capabilities
